<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - DuPont rated buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - DuPont rated buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- JP Morgan said analyst Donald Carson initiated coverage of DuPont Co with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- estimated earnings at $7.35 per share for 1997 and $8.35 for 1998, compared to $6.54 for 1996.</p>
<p>-- said company is &quot;in the midst of a transformation to a company with above-market growth potential from a low-growth, somewhat cyclical chemical and energy entity.&quot;</p>
<p>-- set 12-month price target of $135.</p>
</text>
